================================================================================
<===> error/css_value/mixin/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@mixin m {}
a {b: meta.get-mixin(m)}
<===> error/css_value/mixin/error
Error: get-mixin("m") isn't a valid CSS value.
  ,
3 | a {b: meta.get-mixin(m)}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 3:7  root stylesheet
